     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A* CUSTPF  -- Customer physical file
     A* Library: ESH101
     A*
     A* This is the root reference file. CUSTID is defined here and
     A* referenced via REFFLD in POLICYPF.
     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R CUSTREC
     A*                                     -- Identifiers
     A            CUSTID         7S 0       COLHDG('CUST' 'ID')
     A*                                     -- Descriptive fields
     A            CUSTNAME      40A         COLHDG('CUSTOMER NAME')
     A            PHONE         15A         COLHDG('PHONE')
     A            CITY          25A         COLHDG('CITY')
     A          K CUSTID
